{{#if (eq variant.slug "multi")}}
Poses the opening of a real match, with `mode` being `"solo"` or `"versus"`,
exactly as choosing it from the menu would: `screen` becomes `"countdown"`, both
scores `0`, `winner` `null`, both paddles centered, and all three balls held at
their home points with a full `HOLD_TIME` hold timer. It leaves `simTime` as it
is.

The game runs from there: the hold timers tick down against the delta time and the
launch happens through the game's own code.
{{else}}
{{#if (eq engine.slug "structured-2d")}}
Poses the opening of a real match, with `mode` being `"solo"` or `"versus"`,
exactly as choosing it from the menu would: `screen` becomes `"countdown"`, the
hold timer becomes `HOLD_TIME`, both scores `0`, `winner` `null`, the receiver
left, both paddles centered, and the ball parked. It leaves `simTime` as it is.
{{else}}
Poses the opening of a real match, with `mode` being `"solo"` or `"versus"`,
exactly as choosing it from the menu would: `screen` becomes `"countdown"`,
`holdTimer` becomes `HOLD_TIME`, both scores `0`, `winner` `null`, `receiver`
`"left"`, both paddles centered, and the ball parked. It leaves `simTime` as it
