{{#if (eq engine.slug "none")}}
### `serve()`
{{else if (eq engine.slug "simple-2d")}}
### `serve(state)`
{{else}}
### `serve()`
{{/if}}

{{#if (eq variant.slug "multi")}}
Ends the hold of every waiting ball immediately instead of waiting it out, by
setting the hold timer of every ball whose `held` is `true` to `0`. A ball already
in flight is left as it is. It applies on the `"countdown"` and `"playing"` screens
alone.

The launch itself is yours: on the next frame the game advances, an elapsed hold
timer launches that ball at `SERVE_SPEED` along a fresh random angle.
{{else}}
{{#if (eq engine.slug "structured-2d")}}
Ends the pre-serve hold immediately instead of waiting it out, by setting the
hold timer to `0`. From a live rally it re-parks the ball, clears the trail, and
returns `screen` to `"countdown"` first, so a re-serve and a first serve behave
identically. It applies on the `"countdown"` and `"playing"` screens alone.

The launch itself is yours: on the next frame the game advances, an elapsed
hold launches the ball at `SERVE_SPEED` toward the receiver.
{{else}}
Ends the pre-serve hold immediately instead of waiting it out, by setting
`holdTimer` to `0`. From a live rally it re-parks the ball, clears the trail, and
returns `screen` to `"countdown"` first, so a re-serve and a first serve behave
identically. It applies on the `"countdown"` and `"playing"` screens alone.

The launch itself is yours: on the next frame the game advances, an elapsed
`holdTimer` launches the ball at `SERVE_SPEED` toward `state.receiver`.
{{/if}}
{{/if}}

